Edition notes:

* The optional Tier-2 semantic backend (HNSW / embedding similarity) is gated
  behind a cargo feature and is OFF by default; it is deferred and not vendored in
  this release. Keeping it off by default is what keeps the default build inside
  the air-gap envelope (no network, no C/C++ dependency).
* LiteLLM model price data (MIT, Copyright (c) 2023 Berri AI) — a trimmed copy of its
  `model_prices_and_context_window.json` is compiled into the binary as the default model
  price table (`src/price_baseline.json`, regenerated by `scripts/gen_price_baseline.py`; the
  commit it was taken from is recorded in the file). The MIT permission notice: Permission is
